# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE ON SCOPE, PLEASE READ BEFORE EDITING
#
# This is NOT a copy of the Part II .gitignore. Part II excludes data/, *.tsv,
# *.json and *.png because its inputs are licensed patient records that must
# never be committed. Part I is the opposite case: its data/ directory holds the
# evaluation inputs the paper's validation results are computed from, and those
# files ARE the release. Blanket data patterns would silently exclude the entire
# point of this repository.
#
# What must never be committed here is raw clinical note text. No file in this
# package contains any, and nothing in the pipeline writes any. The patterns
# below cover the accidents that are actually possible.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Clinical note text and cohort extracts. Nothing matching these may ever be
# committed. Names are conservative and deliberately broad.
*note*.csv
*notes*.csv
*_raw_notes*
*cohort*.csv
*patient*.csv
*phi*
root_data/
extracts/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large regenerable inputs
# The ontology and the benchmark corpus are third-party redistributions; if a
# future version of this repository replaces them with a download script,
# uncomment these two lines.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# data/hp.obo
# data/phenotype.hpoa

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and operating systems
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Credentials. Belt and braces; none are used by this code.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets.*
